title: "Orchestral Input Pipeline: Structured Prompt Conditioning for Full-Ensemble AI Music Generation"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: "KEYUR SHAILESHKUMAR"
